    "description": "### Impact\r\n\r\nAn authorization bypass vulnerability allows unauthenticated or unauthorized users to view hidden (staff-only) tags and its associated data.\r\n\r\nAll Discourse instances with tagging enabled and staff-only tag groups configured are impacted.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\n\r\nThe problem was introduced in 2026.2.0-latest and has been patched in 2026.2.0-latest. ",
